<title>USA: Jersey City, N.J. $16.8 mln won by PaineWebber. [CORRECTED 18:01 GMT]</title>
<headline>Jersey City, N.J. $16.8 mln won by PaineWebber. [CORRECTED 18:01 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated said it won $16.8 million of Jersey City, N.J., qualified water bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.52 percent.  </p>
<p>(Corrects name of insurer from MBIA Insurance Corp to Financial Security Assurance.)</p>
